    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32474" root="غمل" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْمُولٌ</span></b> : see 1, near the middle. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also A
man <i>having clothes thrown upon him in order
that he may sweat.</i> (S, O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And Flesh-meat
<i>covered over;</i> whether cooked by roasting or the
like or with broth or gravy; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْمُونٌ</span>.
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And Palm-trees (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْل</span>) <i>near together.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  And A man <i>obscure, unnoted,</i> or <i>reputeless.</i> (As, O, K.)

